  (7, 1, 710, 'Groundsplitter', 'Alucard jumps to the target area and slashes, dealing 270 (+85% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies within the area and slowing them by 40% for 2s.', '8.5', null, array['Mobility', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_7862dada550b5e9258bbefafee78a296.png'),
  (7, 2, 720, 'Whirling Smash', 'Alucard launches a whirling slash, dealing 345 (+120% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to nearby enemies.', '6', null, array['AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f9a0e6ddbddbf009ebb0736e320170fa.png'),
  (7, 3, 730, 'Fission Wave', 'Passive: Alucard permanently gains 10% Hybrid Lifesteal.

Active: Alucard absorbs the energy of enemies in the target area, reducing their Movement Speed by 30% and by 10. He gains 10 for each enemy hero hit and reduces the cooldown of his other skills to 50% for 6s.

Use Again: Alucard releases a powerful shockwave forward, dealing 400 (+200% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage.', '40', null, array['Buff', 'Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d4325e672bb7b7a1add8501525684e19.png'),
  (8, 0, 840, 'Shadow Combo', 'Karina''s third consecutive attack against the same enemy deals 100 (+ 5 (+2.5% Total Magic Power)% target''s Lost ) extra True Damage.

If the target is an enemy hero, this attack also reduces the cooldowns of her non-Ultimate skills by 1.5s.
Damage dealt to creeps is capped at 2000 True Damage.', null, null, array['Buff', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_fb37b0cbc5e9952ec756e3f58c5df22f.png'),
  (8, 1, 810, 'Dance of Blades', 'Karina enters the Dance of Blades state for up to 3.5s, gaining 45% Movement Speed and blocking all Basic Attacks. Blocked attacks trigger a counterattack that deals 100 (+30% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to the attacker (firing a Shadowblade at ranged attackers or triggering Dance of Blades against melee attackers).
This effect has a 0.4s cooldown).

Casting a Basic Attack or Shadow Assault ends the Dance of Blades state, empowering Karina''s next Basic Attack to deal 160 (+60% Total Magic Power) critical Magic Damage and slow the target by 45% for 1s.', '6', '50 mana', array['Buff', 'Speed Up']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_94328c502082dd096eb4be3d95655b07.png'),
  (8, 2, 820, 'Dance of Death', 'Karina launches a spinning slash, dealing 375 (+125% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies.', '6', '60 mana', array['AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_da228e14f0756e84580cb08ede6a1283.png'),
  (8, 3, 830, 'Shadow Assault', 'Karina dashes to the enemy hero, dealing 350 (+160% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage, applying a Shadow Sigil to the target, and leaving a Shadowform behind them.

The Shadow Sigil and Shadowform both last 5s. If the target dies during this time, this skill''s cooldown resets immediately.

Use Again: Karina dashes back to the Shadowform''s location, dealing 150 (+50% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies along the way.', '34', '100 mana', array['Burst', 'Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_889d1d71cef50ed1121ee68b5097954e.png'),
  (9, 0, 940, 'Tai Chi', 'Akai gains a 25 (+5% Max HP) shield for 4s on each skill cast.

