  (9, 1, 910, 'Headbutt', 'Akai charges in the target direction, dealing 300 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies along the way.

Upon hitting an enemy hero, he knocks them airborne for 0.5s and can roll once in the joystick''s direction.

Akai can cast Headbutt during Heavy Spin to quickly reposition himself.', '11', '50 mana', array['Mobility', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4c47ec169528dd5f35ee0792fd26fcf8.png'),
  (9, 2, 920, 'Body Slam', 'Akai slams his body into the ground, dealing 270 (+6% Max HP) Physical Damage to nearby enemies and slowing them by 45% for 2s.', '7', '50 mana', array['AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_57c97caeff255d9d646d4c9b3d100211.png'),
  (9, 3, 930, 'Heavy Spin', 'Akai spins for 4s, continuously dealing 100 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to nearby enemies and knocking them back. Knocked-back enemy heroes also knock back any enemy heroes they collide with.

