  (10, 1, 1010, 'Iron Hook', 'Franco launches an Iron Hook in the target direction. The hook snags the first enemy unit hit, dealing 400 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and dragging them to him.', '15', '135 mana', array['CC', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_eb5032e0d6d264f97c30f95237cc2ed4.png'),
  (10, 2, 1020, 'Fury Shock', 'Franco lashes out, dealing 300 (+ 4% of his ) Physical Damage to nearby enemies, slowing them by 70% for 1.5s.', '7', '40 mana', array['Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4ed340f228f854d69477c6d492ab6046.png'),
  (10, 3, 1030, 'Bloody Hunt', 'Franco suppresses the target enemy hero for 1.8s and strikes them 6 times over the duration, each time dealing 50 (+70% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage.', '62', '110 mana', array['Burst', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b19953d95c51bcb9292e743e84d71071.png'),
  (11, 0, 1140, 'Shark Bite', 'Bane infuses his weapon with a stack of Power of Tide each time he uses a skill (up to 2 stacks). Each of his subsequent Basic Attacks consumes a stack to deal (+95% Total Physical Attack) (+ 4 (+0.4*Hero Level)% target''s ) Physical Damage to nearby enemies.', null, null, array['Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6458e01eb437665b82e4cd27c10a4344.png'),
  (11, 1, 1110, 'Crab Claw Cannon', 'Bane fires his Crab Claw Cannon in the target direction, dealing 150 (+160% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the first enemy hit and then 150% damage to a random enemy behind them (prioritizes enemy heroes). Enemies hit are slowed by 10 (+10% Total Magic Power)% for 1s.
Every 100 Bane possesses reduces this skill''s cooldown by an additional 8%.', '8', '30 mana', array['Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c0b05da138f56fff0f5876884c8a2036.png'),
  (11, 2, 1120, 'Sea Ink', 'Bane swallows a cup of sea ink, recovering HP equal to 200 (+150% Total Magic Power) + 5 (+1.5% Total Magic Power)% of his , and gaining 50% Movement Speed that decays over 2.5s.

