Every 100 Bane possesses reduces this skill''s cooldown by an additional 7%.', '7.5', '50 mana', array['Heal', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c202bb567a0c80d5707288e75fdacfb8.png'),
  (11, 3, 1130, 'Deadly Catch', 'Bane summons a school of sharks to charge in the target direction, dealing 700 (+80% Total Physical Attack) (+150% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit, knocking them airborne for 0.6s, and slowing them by 75% (decays over 3s).
This skill deals 40% damage to turrets.', '40', '120 mana', array['Burst', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_fe8c4a45d27cc7d56b893a31138b8a4d.png'),
  (12, 0, 1240, 'Mecha Legs', 'Bruno gains 2.5% extra Crit Chance each time he deals damage with his skills (up to 8 stacks).

Bruno has higher Physical Attack but only gains 80% extra Attack Speed from all sources.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a1c3c66444e958b880d746e56c285566.png'),
  (12, 1, 1210, 'Volley Shot', 'Bruno kicks a Powerball on his next Basic Attack, gaining 48% Movement Speed for 1s. It deals 100 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the target, and slows them by 30% for 0.5s.

