  (13, 0, 1340, 'Double Shot', 'After each skill cast, Clint''s next Basic Attack within 4s penetrates a line of enemies, dealing 150 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage. This damage can trigger Attack Effects, and the part affected by can Crit.', null, null, array['Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_7adb0a322810b79addc40db494bd1b83.png'),
  (13, 1, 1310, 'Quick Draw', 'Clint fires 5 bullets in quick succession in the target direction, each dealing 250 (+85% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the enemy hit.

The bullets will spread evenly across enemies in a fan-shaped area. Enemies hit by multiple bullets will take less damage after the first bullet.', '8', '50 mana', array['AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_cbbd239b3a6e2f359cc1fb766377bf7f.png'),
  (13, 2, 1320, 'Trapping Recoil', 'Clint shoots a trap net in the target direction, slightly jumping back while dealing 140 (+30% Total Physical Attack) (+150% Total Magic Power) Physical Damage to the first enemy hit and immobilizing them for 1.2s.

