  (14, 0, 1440, 'Divine Resurrection', 'Rafaela can cast a special skill every 10s. After channeling for 2.5s, she instantly resurrects an ally and increases their Movement Speed by 30% for 5s (taking damage from heroes and Legend Creeps interrupts channeling and puts the skill on base cooldown).
This skill''s cooldown is increased by 600% of the target''s remaining respawn time, capped at 240s. This skill is not affected by Cooldown Reduction.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_eb33edd56da79e4dbe8601648e2cb07a.png'),
  (14, 1, 1410, 'Light of Retribution', 'Rafaela strikes the three nearest enemies with Light of Retribution, dealing them 350 (+120% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage, briefly revealing their positions, and slowing them by 40% for 1.5s. Enemies hit by Light of Retribution again within 6s will take 20% extra damage (this effect stacks up to 3 times).', '5', '45 mana', array['AOE', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e3672153fbf1dbeb4a98243958f9deb7.png'),
  (14, 2, 1420, 'Holy Healing', 'Rafaela calls upon Holy Light, recovering 100 (+35% Total Magic Power) HP to nearby allied heroes, plus an additional 150 (+65% Total Magic Power) HP to herself and the most injured allied hero in range. She also increases the Movement Speed of nearby allied heroes by 30% and grants Slow Immunity for 1s.
Every 10 increases the Movement Speed bonus by 1%.', '10.5', '75 mana', array['Heal', 'Speed Up']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a4ce274e4ea7ccb436e0adfec05457aa.png'),
  (14, 3, 1430, 'Holy Baptism', 'Rafaela unleashes the true power of Holy Light in the target direction, dealing 460 (+120% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in a line and stunning them for 1.2s.', '38', '120 mana', array['CC', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_70f534ce6bfaa6640646551419211d4c.png'),
  (15, 0, 1540, 'Superconductor', 'Eudora''s skills inflict Superconductor for 5s on non-minion units hit and can trigger additional effects against enemies affected by Superconductor.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4ac316bbaf343836fdc741c84ca5da45.png'),
  (15, 1, 1510, 'Forked Lightning', 'Eudora casts Forked Lightning in a fan-shaped area, dealing 275 (+100% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage (increased to 200% against minions) to enemies within.

When hitting targets affected by Superconductor, Eudora forms a lightning chain with the target, gaining 40% Movement Speed during the chain for up to 1s.
The lightning chain deals 10 (+4% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage over time and an additional 275 (+100% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage when it ends. If this hit lands, it reduces this skill''s cooldown by 50%.', '5', '40 mana', array['AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_17018b4270f7fd04eb235499eb629861.png'),
  (15, 2, 1520, 'Ball Lightning', 'Eudora hurls an orb of lightning at the target enemy, reducing their by 10 for 1.8s, dealing 300 (+50% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage, and stunning them for 1s.

If the target is affected by Superconductor, the lightning orb reduces nearby enemies'' , deals AOE damage centered on the target, and stuns all nearby enemies.', '11', '80 mana', array['CC', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ee8360b2b38255f04226a627561564fe.png'),
  (15, 3, 1530, 'Thunder’s Wrath', 'Eudora calls down a blast of lightning on the target area, dealing 600 (+160% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to targets at the center. Then it strikes targets outside the center, dealing 300 (+100% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage.

