If the target''s HP is below 50%, all damage dealt by Zilong''s skills and Basic Attacks is increased by 30.', null, null, array['Buff', 'Heal']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_588b6273f7a0153bebe86f7ed6bb7e18.png'),
  (16, 1, 1610, 'Spear Flip', 'Zilong flings the target enemy over his head, dealing 250 (+80% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage.', '12', '80 mana', array['CC', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_effcecb9dba41aa5fa1c34edad4d7e17.png'),
  (16, 2, 1620, 'Spear Strike', 'Zilong lunges at the target enemy, dealing 250 (+60% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and reducing their by 15 for 2s.

