  (17, 3, 1730, 'Cut Throat', 'Fanny leaps at the target enemy hero or Creep with her blades, dealing 400 (+200% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage. Each stack of Prey Mark on the target increases this damage by 30%.', '35', '12 energy', array['Burst', 'Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c7f6411c4bb0027e0fbd8ef98ef7e770.png'),
  (18, 0, 1840, 'Malefic Gun', 'Layla deals increased damage to targets farther away from her (starting at 100% and increasing to 115% at 6 units away). This does not apply to Turrets.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ba25b082b2a373138d398a32499e0544.png'),
  (18, 1, 1810, 'Malefic Bomb', 'Layla fires a Malefic Bomb in the target direction, dealing 200 (+80% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the first enemy hit (can Crit).

Upon hitting an enemy, Layla''s Basic Attacks and Void Projectile gain extra range for 3s, and she gains 60% extra Movement Speed that decays over 1.2s. The duration of the Movement Speed boost is doubled if an enemy hero is hit.', '6', '35 mana', array['Burst', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b00ff9edafd44eeee4af815f24c14653.png'),
  (18, 2, 1820, 'Void Projectile', 'Layla fires an orb of Malefic Energy at the target, dealing 170 (+65% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the target and nearby enemies and applying a Magic Mark to the target for 3s.
When Layla hits an enemy with a Magic Mark, she deals 100 (+35% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the target and nearby enemies, stunning them for 0.25s.', '7.5', '70 mana', array['AOE', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_03f3b37b699108735c77c0197acac646.png'),
  (18, 3, 1830, 'Destruction Rush', 'Passive: The range of Void Projectile and Basic Attacks is increased by 0.6 units. Layla''s sight range is slightly increased each time this skill is upgraded.
Active: Layla fires a blast of Malefic Energy in the target direction, dealing 500 (+150% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in a line.', '37', '130 mana', array['Burst', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8410070e72f25785078a91c793a39cc0.png'),
  (19, 0, 1940, 'Rage Incarnate', 'After casting a skill, Minotaur gains Motivation, recovering HP equal to 5 (+1*Hero Level)% of damage taken from enemy heroes for 3s.

Enraged State: Motivation HP recovery is increased to 200%.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4296561c81f79f3960c72c6d707a2f86.png'),
  (19, 1, 1910, 'Despair Stomp', 'Minotaur jumps to the target location, dealing 325 (+60% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in the area and briefly knocking them airborne. Enemies hit will also be slowed by 40% while Minotaur enhances his Basic Attacks to deal 25 (+5% Max HP) extra Physical Damage for 2s.

Enraged: Increases the AOE range and the damage dealt by 25 (+5% Max HP) Physical Damage.', '12', null, array['CC', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a902b3f75e08b180503d02796804baae.png'),
  (19, 2, 1920, 'Motivation Roar', 'Minotaur heals himself and the nearby ally with the lowest HP, recovering 220 (+60% Total Magic Power) HP for both. He also recovers an additional 8% of his lost .

Enraged: Minotaur heals himself and all nearby allied heroes.', '10', null, array['Heal', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_72ead6458b2fd5fa001d4cc594ee37a8.png'),
  (19, 3, 1930, 'Minoan Fury', 'Minotaur enters Enraged state and smashes the ground 3 times. The first 2 hits deal 180 (+85% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to nearby enemies and slow them by 60%, while the final hit deals 200 (+85% Total Physical Attack) True Damage and knocks targets airborne for 0.8s. Minotaur is immune to control effects during this attack.

The Enraged state lasts 12s and enhances Minotaur''s skills for the duration.', '60', null, array['CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8b1d72b921c47c7dcb68a25c4289412a.png'),
  (20, 0, 2040, 'Noumenon Energy Core', 'Every 6s to 3s (scales with Noumenon Blast level), the Noumenon Energy Core grants Lolita 20 (+2.5% Max HP) (+20% Total Magic Power) shield. When Lolita casts a skill, the Noumenon Energy Core grants Lolita and nearby allied heroes an extra shield. This shield can stack up to 3 times and lasts 30s.', null, null, array['Shield']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8c26e0d0018fb46934ec1e079ddbe695.png'),
  (20, 1, 2010, 'Power Charge', 'Lolita dashes in the target direction. Her next Basic Attack within 4s will perform a short dash to the target, dealing 400 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and stunning them for 0.5s. This damage is doubled against Minions.', '10', '70 mana', array['Mobility', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e1554a16e239a56ab24a59ed06542a07.png'),
  (20, 2, 2020, 'Guardian''s Reflection', 'Lolita raises her shield and reflects all incoming ranged Basic Attacks and Projectiles in the direction of the shield for 3s. The shield will break after taking 1000 (+15% Max HP) damage.

The damage and effects from the Unique Passives of an attacker''s equipment will not apply to the shield and will not be reflected. This skill can be interrupted by high level control effects.', '15', '90 mana', array['Shield', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c667899aa7f531fa5b199327be638d54.png'),
  (20, 3, 2030, 'Noumenon Blast', 'Passive: Reduces the interval of Noumenon Energy Core by 1s each time this skill is upgraded.

Active: Lolita begins charging for 2s while slowing enemies in a fan-shaped area by 60%. When the charging is complete or is stopped, Lolita slams her hammer on the ground, dealing up to 600 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in the area and stunning them for up to 2s (damage and stun duration scale with charge time).

Use Again: Lolita immediately stops charging and slams her hammer on the ground.', '55', '100 mana', array['CC', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_139bfe9c5e5ab063c0988222a5a3c456.png'),
  (21, 0, 2140, 'Ninjutsu: Trace of Shadow', 'Hayabusa''s attacks apply a stack of Shadow Mark on hit (up to 4 stacks). Each stack lasts 6s and increases Hayabusa''s damage to the enemy by 5%.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1255ed2b33be690a777dce8a797557c1.png'),
  (21, 1, 2110, 'Ninjutsu: Phantom Shuriken', 'Passive: Hayabusa permanently gains 3% Spell Vamp.
Active: Hayabusa throws three returning shurikens in the target direction, each dealing 220 (+75% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit and slowing them by 35% for 2s. Subsequent hits on the same enemy deal 70% less damage (only 50% less to creeps). He also restores 10 Energy when hitting non-minion enemies.', '4', '30 energy', array['Damage', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2291f23ec06da9b9f312dd985bfd47a9.png'),
  (21, 2, 2120, 'Ninjutsu: Quad Shadow', 'Hayabusa dashes in the target direction and releases four phantoms that travel in separate directions. The phantoms will remain at the end of their paths or attach themselves to the first enemy hero hit, dealing 130 (+30% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage and slowing them by 40% for 2s. Hayabusa will immediately stop if he hits an enemy hero during the dash.

Use Again: Hayabusa teleports to a phantom''s location and reduces the cooldown of Ninjutsu: Phantom Shuriken by 1s. If the phantom is attached to an enemy hero, he also deals 130 (+30% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the enemy.', '16', '25 energy', array['Mobility', 'Summon']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_76a4c1e8322ddec04759efa14a3ab3ff.png'),
  (21, 3, 2130, 'Ougi: Shadow Kill', 'Hayabusa blends into the shadows and launches 6 single-target attacks on enemies in the area, each dealing 130 (+30% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage.

The attacks prioritize enemies with Shadow Mark and each will consume a mark to deal 90 (+40% Extra Physical Attack) extra Physical Damage. Shadow Kill does not apply Shadow Mark.', '40', null, array['Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_725ee5582eb697e37896e8a6b81442d9.png'),
  (22, 0, 2260, 'Power of Einherjar', 'Freya gains 1 Sacred Orb with each Basic Attack (up to 6 Sacred Orbs). Consuming 1 Sacred Orb grants Freya 100% Attack Speed for her next Basic Attack (up to 6 stacks).

While out of combat, Sacred Orbs regenerate gradually.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_dcd7beb4c0cef38f848a6cf26e51b105.png'),
  (22, 1, 2299, 'Leap of Faith', 'Freya leaps to the target area and strikes the ground with her shield, gaining 500 (+100% Total Physical Attack) shield and dealing 200 (+80% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies within while knocking them airborne for 0.4s.', '8', null, array['CC', 'Shield']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c2350b4a4d8b8526e9e19c4daba69155.png'),
  (22, 2, 2298, 'Valkyrie Slash', 'Freya charges forward and slashes, dealing 150 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and slowing enemies by 30% for 0.5s.
This skill has no base cooldown but consumes 2 Sacred Orbs per cast.
It deals 50% damage to creeps.', '0.396', null, array['Mobility', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e14d289ed1917b89945f8d502c05d9c6.png'),
  (22, 3, 2250, 'Valkyrie Descent', 'Freya selects a target area and dives down as a Sacred Orb (gaining Control Immunity), dealing 300 (+75% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and 40% slow to enemies in her path and at the landing point for 2s. Upon landing, Freya enters the Valkyrie state for 10s, during which her Basic Attacks deal 30 extra damage (extra damage cannot Crit), she recovers 40 (+40% Total Physical Attack) HP per Basic Attack, and her Basic Attacks deal splash damage.', '44', null, array['Morph', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_49a8b4de271d0162ab9e26e06819840e.png'),
  (23, 0, 2340, 'Mystic Favor', 'After Gord hits an enemy 4 times with skills within a short period of time, the next skill damage will deal an additional 120 (+8*Hero Level) (+40% Total Magic Power) True Damage and slow them by 20% for 1s (the slow effect stacks up to 2 times).', null, null, array['Buff', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d001e3ffc019ed6a944faa42e6bc7d4c.png'),
  (23, 1, 2310, 'Mystic Projectile', 'Gord conjures a Mystic Orb that bounces in the target direction and explodes on the first enemy hit, dealing 225 (+65% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in the area, while stunning them and revealing their locations for 1s.', '8', '80 mana', array['CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e44e97b68e56e6488c6148f3f1caad2e.png'),
  (23, 2, 2320, 'Mystic Injunction', 'Gord creates an energy field in the target area, dealing 30 (+10% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage every 0.25s to enemies within (up to 16 times).', '8', '60 mana', array['AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e764ce9be81a6d36bde6c3603ac98812.png'),
  (23, 3, 2330, 'Mystic Gush', 'Gord unleashes an energy beam in the target direction, dealing 90 (+32% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit every 0.2s (up to 16 times).

The direction of the beam can be adjusted using the Joystick.', '44', '150 mana', array['Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5609f4cebb87e2d2fa52c4419a8d3a63.png'),
  (24, 0, 2440, 'Assassin Instinct', 'If Natalia stays in a bush without taking damage for 1s, she will enter Camouflage state and gain 15% Movement Speed. In this state, Natalia''s next Basic Attack will teleport her behind her target and deal 200 (+110% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage while silencing the target for 0.25s.

Dealing damage, taking damage or using skills will immediately end the Camouflage state, but her next Basic Attack will remain enhanced for another 1s.

Natalia''s base Crit Damage is reduced to 150%, but her damage to Creeps is increased to 150%.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_70c63dbf8a6c5f7c13e000e50cb45048.png'),
  (24, 1, 2410, 'Claw Dash', 'Natalia dashes in the target direction, dealing 250 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in her path.

After hitting an enemy, she can cast this skill again within 5s.', '10', null, array['Mobility', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9fe9f13f142891ef055c36a9c5fe8e56.png'),
  (24, 2, 2420, 'Smoke Bomb', 'Natalia releases a Smoke Bomb at her location, slowing enemies within by 25% while Natalia becomes immune to enemy Basic Attacks for 4s.', '12', null, array['Buff', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b2dc19263463a18f2a7706ff9ceb90d9.png'),
  (24, 3, 2430, 'The Hunt', 'Passive: Natalia gains 15% Crit Chance.

Active: Natalia immediately enters the Assassin Instinct state. She can store up to 2 Ultimate charges, and each charge has a recharge time of 30s. Killing creeps reduces the remaining recharge time by 50% of the full recharge time.', '3', null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a505102cf3c9127d94b3fa4ae5de6734.png'),
  (25, 0, 2540, 'Yin Yang Gathering', 'Upon retrieving the Seimei Umbrella, Kagura gains a 450 (+80% Total Magic Power) shield, stuns nearby enemies for 0.5s, and slows them by 60% for 1s. Cooldown: 4.5s.', null, null, array['Shield', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f022f5769cb87dee7944160a24f03b79.png'),
  (25, 1, 2510, 'Seimei Umbrella Open', 'Kagura sends the Seimei Umbrella to the target location, dealing 365 (+105% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in its path and slowing them by 60% for 0.5s. The Umbrella will automatically return to Kagura when she''s too far away.
This skill deals 130% damage to non-hero enemies.', '5', '45 mana', array['Damage', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_cc6ff81df0961e494e8c5f3e42f582fe.png'),
  (25, 2, 2520, 'Rasho Umbrella Flee', 'Kagura removes all debuffs on her and leaps in the target direction, while leaving the Seimei Umbrella behind.', '12', '55 mana', array['Remove CC', 'Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_292caeb01278d75ba3e02457e9ddb603.png'),
  (25, 3, 2530, 'Yin Yang Overturn', 'Kagura invokes the power of the Seimei Umbrella, dealing 250 (+95% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies, knocking them back, and slowing them by 60% for 0.5s.', '36', '60 mana', array['CC', 'Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_07f828b02ce64ae8ded3b3ede8893b53.png'),
  (25, 4, 2511, 'Seimei Umbrella Open', 'Kagura sends the Seimei Umbrella to the target location, dealing 365 (+105% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in its path and slowing them by 60% for 0.5s. The Umbrella will automatically return to Kagura when she''s too far away.
This skill deals 130% damage to non-hero enemies.', '5', '45 mana', array['Damage', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8df435b74a7fcd429e89dd381e5ea452.png'),
  (25, 5, 2521, 'Rasho Umbrella Flee', 'Kagura teleports to the Seimei Umbrella''s location and retrieves it, dealing 300 (+90% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to the nearby enemies.', '12', '55 mana', array['Mobility', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_210c67437a6d0722052086bfcca1e20d.png'),
  (25, 6, 2531, 'Yin Yang Overturn', 'Kagura resets the cooldown of Seimei Umbrella Open, dealing 235 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies around the Seimei Umbrella and slowing them by 60%. After 1.5s, enemy heroes around the umbrella are pulled to the center and take 480 (+155% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage.', '36', '60 mana', array['Burst', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0329949e3af570f3c65b46f1d12bf637.png'),
  (26, 0, 2640, 'Only Fast', 'After traveling 5 units, Chou deals 180% damage on his next Basic Attack (cannot Crit), briefly slows the target by 90%, and reduces their by 10 (+1*Hero Level) for 3s (up to 2 stacks).', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_aca76a3a3dda44b6a0c3a72ff9bbcb94.png'),
  (26, 1, 2610, 'Jeet Kune Do', 'Chou strikes in the target direction, dealing 180 (+70% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit. This skill can be cast 3 times before it goes on cooldown. On the 3rd cast, Chou also knocks enemies hit airborne.

Hitting an enemy hero with the 3rd cast resets the cooldown of Shunpo.', '9.5', null, array['AOE', 'Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_70b2990486b562415dac32dac01bdb16.png'),
  (26, 2, 2620, 'Shunpo', 'Chou charges in the target direction, gaining Control Immunity and a 200 (+200% Extra Physical Attack) shield.', '5', null, array['Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d784b75324318b23edb29b1fdd06bea0.png'),
  (26, 3, 2630, 'The Way of Dragon', 'Chou strikes a roundhouse kick at the target enemy hero, dealing them 400 (+200% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage and knocking them back.

Cast the skill again to chase up the target, dealing a total of 480 (+240% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage.', '36', null, array['CC', 'Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_05083715344213a996ab3ebf04381e93.png'),
  (27, 0, 2740, 'Simian God', 'Enemies hit by Sun or his Doppelgangers will have their reduced by 5% (stacks up to 6 times). Sun recovers HP equal to 75 plus 15% of the Doppelganger''s Physical Attack each time a Doppelganger deals damage.
Sun or his Doppelgangers'' Basic Attacks deal 65 extra damage to creeps.', null, null, array['Debuff', 'Heal']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6d93eddf722334375d384ee8965f95f7.png'),
  (27, 1, 2710, 'Endless Variety', 'Sun hurls his Golden Staff in the target direction, dealing 280 (+40% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in its path. Upon hitting an enemy hero or creep or reaching maximum range, the Golden Staff morphs into a Doppelganger that pursues enemies. The Doppelganger inherits Sun''s attributes, deals 60% damage, and takes 150% damage for 5s.

This skill shares its level and cooldown with Swift Exchange.', '6.5', '70 mana', array['Summon', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0d813a2495b9950a4a57fb9e750212ba.png'),
  (27, 2, 2750, 'Swift Exchange', 'Sun hurls his Golden Staff in the target direction, dealing 280 (+40% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in its path.

He conjures a Doppelganger at his location that inherits his attributes, deals 60% damage, and takes 150% damage for 5s.
Sun transforms into the Golden Staff and becomes concealed, reappearing at its maximum range.', '6.5', '70 mana', array['Mobility', 'Summon']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_7afa1977abd09809a0cfacccfd2f5cfd.png'),
  (27, 3, 2720, 'Instantaneous Move', 'Sun commands his Doppelgangers to strike at the target enemy with him, dealing 270 (+40% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and slowing the target and enemies behind them by 25% (can be stacked) for 1.5s. This counts as Basic Attack damage and can trigger Attack Effects but cannot Crit.', '5', '40 mana', array['Burst', 'Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_871502bcbd804479198c0374db30dd5a.png'),
  (27, 4, 2730, 'Clone Techniques', 'Sun summons a Doppelganger that inherits his attributes, deals 80% damage, and takes 120% damage for 8s.', '32', null, array['Summon']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_18d2d2e16311dff12a1a8518fc823e4d.png'),
  (28, 0, 2840, 'Beta, Advance!', 'When Alpha uses a skill, Beta will be summoned to attack. Enemies that are hit by Beta 2 time(s) will be Locked On.

Locked On: After Alpha deals damage to the target, Beta will fire a laser at them, dealing 60 (+50% Total Physical Attack) (+8*Hero Level) True Damage and briefly applying a powerful slow effect.
This skill only deals 75% damage to Creeps.', null, null, array['Damage', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6b3c9aef499eeb19ec98dfbac22bb33c.png'),
  (28, 1, 2810, 'Rotary Impact', 'Alpha unleashes an energy wave in the target direction, dealing 100 (+90% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in its path and slowing them by 40% for 1s.

Beta then strafes enemies along the same path, dealing 60 (+30% Extra Physical Attack) True Damage.', '4', '50 mana', array['AOE', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8feb5b13b48b71de18f1490269cb1623.png'),
  (28, 2, 2820, 'Force Swing', 'After a short delay, Alpha swings his blade in the target direction, dealing 180 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in a fan-shaped area and recovering 80 (+40% Extra Physical Attack) HP for the first enemy hit (healing decays by 40% for each additional enemy hit).

Beta then strafes enemies in the same area, dealing 60 (+30% Total Physical Attack) True Damage.', '6', '45 mana', array['AOE', 'Heal']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_601fedfb2ef64598acdf449ad2b29216.png'),
  (28, 3, 2830, 'Spear of Alpha', 'Beta dives to the target location, dealing 100 (+20% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit and stunning them for 1s. Alpha then leaps towards the same location, knocking enemies in his path airborne and carrying them to the landing location. Alpha then slams down, dealing 250 (+100% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage and slowing the enemies by 40% for 1.5s.

Beta then attacks the same area 5 times, dealing 15 (+30% Extra Physical Attack) True Damage each time.', null, null, array['Mobility', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_7f192b19efc5c9dcbd6e5c11e187e86d.png'),
  (29, 0, 2940, 'Let''s Dance!', 'Ruby''s skills have a 75% Spell Vamp Ratio (her Basic Attacks cannot trigger Lifesteal). For every 1% HP lost, her Spell Vamp Ratio increases by 1%, up to 150%.

After each skill cast, Ruby can dash to another location and gain 8-25 (scales with level) for 4s (stacks up to 3 times).', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_262dcfb1e67c19e273ac2409098c8b5d.png'),
  (29, 1, 2910, 'Be Good!', 'Ruby swings her scythe, dealing 280 (+110% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit. She then unleashes a shockwave in the same direction, dealing 140 (+55% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit and slowing them by 40% for 1s.', '4', '25 mana', array['AOE', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3ada6c7426a96d2d9b00fbaf7a0068d4.png'),
  (29, 2, 2920, 'Don''t Run, Wolf King!', 'Ruby swings her scythe around herself twice, each swing dealing 60 (+55% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to nearby enemies, stunning them for 0.5s, and slowly pulling them toward her.', '7', '50 mana', array['CC', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_eaf4da37b9211deccc9c0452c0853887.png'),
  (29, 3, 2930, 'I''m Offended!', 'Ruby sweeps her scythe in the target direction, dealing 600 (+200% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit, pulling them toward her, and stunning them for 0.5s.', '40', '80 mana', array['CC', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_de4c25c06cc0816c7be8638d52d2dfce.png'),
  (30, 0, 3040, 'Heavenly Vow', 'Yi Sun-shin attacks with his longbow or glaive based on his distance from the target.
Weapon Mastery: After each weapon swap, his next 2 Basic Attacks gain extra Attack Speed and deal 70% and 55% Crit Damage respectively. He also gains 15% Movement Speed for 1s.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_708b471cf829d9ffb5d892a79b17d710.png'),
  (30, 1, 3010, 'Traceless', 'Yi Sun-shin dashes forward and slashes with his glaive, dealing 150 (+40% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and gaining Control Immunity for 0.4s.
Each Weapon Mastery triggered reduces the cooldown of Traceless by 1s.', '12', '50 mana', array['Mobility', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_abd7c311019ffb1e4210092e448a445e.png'),
  (30, 2, 3020, 'Blood Floods', 'Tap: Yi Sun-shin slashes swiftly with his glaive, dealing 240 (+80% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage.
Hold: Yi Sun-shin shoots a powerful arrow forward, dealing 240 (+80% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the target (damage scales with hold time, up to 200%).
Casting this skill immediately triggers Weapon Mastery.', '11', '60 mana', array['AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_cbefbe66ac78ac29ec20d14a057c30a5.png'),
  (30, 3, 3030, 'Mountain Shocker', 'Yi Sun-shin summons a turtle ship and reveals the whole map for 2s. The turtle ship lasts up to 10s, during which he gains 70% burst Movement Speed (decays to 20% over 2s).

Use Again: Yi Sun-shin commands the turtle ship to ram the target area, dealing 160 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in the center and stunning them for 0.8s. Meanwhile, he commands the naval fleet to launch 3 waves of cannon attacks over a larger area. Each wave deals 160 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and slows enemies by 30%.
Casting this skill immediately triggers Weapon Mastery.', '60', '150 mana', array['Burst', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_fa5511e292c6b516b1b258b13ab0f883.png'),
  (31, 0, 3140, 'Spear of Quiescence', 'Moskov''s Basic Attacks can penetrate the target and deal (+68% Total Physical Attack)- (+110% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies behind them (scales with hero level). Each Basic Attack hit reduces the cooldowns of Abyss Walker by 0.8s and Spear of Misery by 0.8s.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_598dfa238e4987c45419783b299aa4fc.png'),
  (31, 1, 3110, 'Abyss Walker', 'Moskov teleports to the target location, increasing his Attack Speed to 1.15 times for 3s. Meanwhile, his Basic Attack deals (+10% Total Physical Attack) more damage to enemies behind the primary target.', '10', '50 mana', array['Mobility', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ad0a57328e772be2fa70550692507a86.png'),
  (31, 2, 3120, 'Spear of Misery', 'Moskov launches a powerful strike at the target enemy hero or Creep, dealing 300 (+60% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage, knocking them back, and revealing their position for 2s.

If the target collides with an enemy hero when knocked back, they''ll both take 200 (+30% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and be stunned for 1.2s. If the enemy is knocked into a wall, they will also be stunned for the same duration.', '12', '90 mana', array['CC', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_108c7b9f3ac11309bbcdf0bf1b185d46.png'),
  (31, 3, 3130, 'Spear of Destruction', 'After a short delay, Moskov throws the Spear of Destruction in the target direction, dealing 340 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in its path and to the first enemy hero hit. Upon hitting an enemy hero, the spear pierces them, dealing 10% extra Physical Damage to enemies behind them. The target and enemies hit by the piercing damage will be slowed by 50% for 1s (the slow duration scales with the spear''s travel time, up to 3s).

When Spear of Destruction hits the first enemy hero, it creates a shadow behind them and refreshes the cooldown of Abyss Walker.

Use Again: Moskov casts Abyss Walker from the shadow''s location (shares the same cooldown as the skill).', '55', '130 mana', array['Slow', 'Teleport']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f51734d9a49d298d05e1dc81d8e740c2.png'),
  (32, 0, 3240, 'Electro Airbag', 'When Johnson''s HP drops below 30%, he gains a 300 (+700% Total Physical Defense) shield for 10s. Cooldown: 100s.', null, null, array['Shield']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_df5fccf91538ea84c5ce22d59d217a5a.png'),
  (32, 1, 3210, 'Impact Wrench', 'Johnson throws his wrench toward the target location, dealing 120 (+220% Total Physical Defense) Magic Damage to enemies in its path. Enemies around the landing point are stunned for 0.8s.', '8', null, array['CC', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_931a5157d2fadc2f1fe0d6d4941c2939.png'),
  (32, 2, 3220, 'Electromagnetic Waves', 'Johnson raises his shield, continuously dealing 120 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in a fan-shaped area in the target direction, reducing their Movement Speed and by 10% (stacks up to 3 times) for 2s.

While his shield is raised, Johnson can perform Basic Attacks and cast skills.', '10', null, array['AOE', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d559adcd5b3f996872c0db6b7673c86c.png'),
  (32, 3, 3230, 'Full Throttle', 'Passive: Johnson''s is increased by 10%.
Active: Johnson transforms into a car. Nearby allied heroes can use Hop In to ride with him (only 1 at a time). When the car hits an enemy hero, it explodes and deals 300 (+240% Total Physical Defense)–450 (+360% Total Physical Defense) Magic Damage to nearby enemies, stunning them for 0.5–1s (scales with driving time). It also creates an electrified zone at the location that continuously deals 60 (+20% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and slows enemies within.
Johnson''s location is revealed to enemies for 3s when he casts this skill.', '36', null, array['Morph', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3b552855efed5343debb078d885c15f8.png'),
  (33, 0, 3340, 'Starlit Hourglass', 'Each time Cyclops hits an enemy with his skills, all his skill cooldowns are reduced by 0.5s.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f7b43d6e79d4116016d639302e00ebc4.png'),
  (33, 1, 3310, 'Stardust Shock', 'Cyclops casts two Stardust Disks in the target direction, each dealing 240 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in its path.', '7.5', '50 mana', array['AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c79390698655479c4999a82b9d84a932.png'),
  (33, 2, 3320, 'Planets Attack', 'Cyclops conjures Starlit Spheres around himself, gaining 50% Movement Speed that decays over 2s.

The Starlit Spheres automatically seek and attack nearby enemies (prioritizing enemy heroes), and explode on contact to deal 200 (+65% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage.
Subsequent hits on the same target deal reduced damage.', '14', '60 mana', array['Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8702dc193a729d21627b4c37d21dd671.png'),
  (33, 3, 3330, 'Star Power Lockdown', 'Cyclops creates a Planetary Sphere that tracks the target enemy hero or creep, dealing 500 (+120% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and immobilizing them for 0.75-1.5s (scales with Planetary Sphere''s travel distance).', '26', '60 mana', array['CC', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9e7801c3fa4c06fdcc7383f3b9eb8b44.png'),
  (34, 0, 3440, 'Scripture of the Moon Elf', 'Scripture of the Moon Elf slowly charges energy for Estes. Upon reaching 100 stacks, it enhances his next Basic Attack, dealing 250 (+100% Total Physical Attack) (+150% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to the target. The attack will ricochet to nearby enemies, dealing 125 (+50% Total Physical Attack) (+75% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and slowing them by 60% for 1.5s.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0eb30f512750394ac949651d801d92f0.png'),
  (34, 1, 3410, 'Moonlight Immersion', 'Estes recovers 200 (+110% Total Magic Power) HP for the target allied hero immediately and links himself with them for 5s.
While linked, both heroes gain 15 (+10% Total Magic Power) , and the target slowly recovers 360 (+90% Total Magic Power) HP. Linking with an allied hero increases Estes'' Movement Speed by 15%, as well as the energy charging speed of the Scripture of the Moon Elf.
Being too far from the target will break the link.', '11', '60 mana', array['Heal', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f5b04cea7f95a5fd378699c764f39384.png'),
  (34, 2, 3420, 'Domain of Moon Goddess', 'Estes drops a flood of moonlight on the target area, dealing 350 (+70% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemy units within it. Afterwards, it turns to a domain of the Moon Goddess and reveals enemies inside it. Enemies will be slowed by 90% for 1.5s if they touch the edge of the domain area. (The slow effect will decay over time.)', '12', '80 mana', array['Slow', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_207a8204b952f50031ad3ca3c6abea42.png'),
  (34, 3, 3430, 'Blessing of Moon Goddess', 'Estes casts an enhanced Moonlight Immersion on himself and all nearby allied heroes, refreshing Moonlight Immersion on them and enhancing it for 8s.
Enhanced Moonlight Immersion: Doubles the Instant Basic Healing and Increase, and heals the target for 1020 (+225% Total Magic Power) HP over time.', '55', '140 mana', array['Heal', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0bc801eaf911ceb696997fbe43105440.png'),
  (35, 0, 3540, 'Blessing of Wilderness', 'Hilda recovers 2% HP per second while in the bush. Entering a bush enhances her next Basic Attack, which deals 110 (+130% Total Physical Attack)(+12*Hero Level) Physical Damage to the target, reduces the target''s Movement Speed by 40%, and deals 40 (+100% Total Physical Attack)(+10*Hero Level) Physical Damage to enemies behind the target. After using the enhanced Basic Attack, this effect enters a 6s cooldown.

Hilda''s Basic Attack and skills apply a Wilderness Mark on hit, which lasts up to 4s and stacks up to 6 times. Each stack reduces the enemy hero''s by 3%.', null, null, array['Buff', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_34b0dddc37a0bd20d686616d9b7b984e.png'),
  (35, 1, 3510, 'Combat Ritual', 'Hilda gains 60% Movement Speed for 3s and receives a shield that absorbs damage equal to 10% , lasting 3s.', '10', null, array['Speed Up', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c2ffa9fe6df7c70e85144e9250f0f5bf.png'),
  (35, 2, 3520, 'Art of Hunting', 'Hilda locks onto an enemy target, dealing 200 (+90% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage per hit. This skill can be cast up to 3 times. The 2nd attack deals extra damage to nearby enemies. The 3rd attack deals damage to the target and nearby enemies, knocking them back briefly.', '7', null, array['Damage', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2f407178c40dbabccf8d787b2e0e30cc.png'),
  (35, 3, 3530, 'Power of Wildness', 'Hilda launches a powerful slash at the target enemy, dealing 600 (+250% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage and stunning them for 0.2s. Nearby enemies take 60% of the damage.

Each stack of Wilderness Mark increases Power of Wildness''s damage by 2.5% of the target''s . At max stacks, the extra damage increases to 20% of the target''s .', '32', null, array['Burst', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_323f1e87195d3a50d0c307f239241b61.png'),
  (36, 0, 3640, 'Pride of Ice', 'Upon taking fatal damage, Aurora freezes herself for 1.5s, becoming invincible during this time and gradually recovering 30% . This effect has a 150s cooldown.

Aurora''s freeze effects can also affect Turrets.', null, null, array['Death Immunity']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c6d80942b639b97fbeffc5fd9ee8167e.png'),
  (36, 1, 3610, 'Hailstone Blast', 'Aurora summons an icy meteorite to strike at the target location, dealing 400 (+90% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and slowing targets hit by 40% for 1s. Afterward, 5 hailstones fall, each dealing 40 (+10% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage.', '5', '60 mana', array['AOE', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_209d6465a2c64f50265810fcbaa0c8bb.png'),
  (36, 2, 3620, 'Frosty Breeze', 'Aurora blows Frosty Breeze in a fan-shaped area in the target direction, dealing 225 (+75% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit and creating a frozen area at the far end.

The area deals a total of 225 (+75% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies within and freezes them for 1s (increases by 0.06s for every 100 ).', '10', '75 mana', array['CC', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ef80a610e18430d6ff01ee049d08a489.png'),
  (36, 3, 3630, 'Frigid Glacier', 'Aurora creates a frost path in the target direction, dealing 100 (+40% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in the path and slowing them by 80% for 1.2s.

The frost path gradually expands into a glacier that shatters at maximum size, dealing 600 (+150% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to all enemies in the area and freezing them for 1s (increases by 0.2s for every 100 ).', '50', '140 mana', array['CC', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_42818d794bbe6206d10e9658013ab033.png'),
  (37, 0, 3740, 'Homeland Defender', 'Lapu-Lapu accumulates 10 Bravery Blessing each time he deals damage (halved for damage dealt to non-hero units). When Bravery Blessing is full, Lapu-Lapu''s next Basic Attack will make him dash toward the target, dealing (+150% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage (cannot Crit) and granting him a shield that absorbs 250 (+65*Hero Level) damage for 2.5s.', null, null, array['Buff', 'Shield']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_49ec4c6534f7d54b1b490a966bcb431f.png'),
  (37, 1, 3710, 'Justice Blades', 'Lapu-Lapu releases two boomerangs in the target direction, each boomerang dealing 140 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit on its way out and back.

Enemies hit by both boomerangs take 50% damage from the second hit.', '6', null, array['AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e7cb2f98d19635f68bcf1c9a322daf6a.png'),
  (37, 2, 3720, 'Jungle Warrior', 'Lapu-Lapu dashes in the target direction, dealing 100 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies along the way.', '10', null, array['Mobility', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_24322baddfd959a497671ec25ebe91a7.png'),
  (37, 3, 3730, 'Bravest Fighter', 'Lapu-Lapu leaps to the target location while combining his twin blades into one, dealing 300 (+80% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to nearby enemies upon landing and slowing them by 60% for 1s. (This skill cannot be interrupted.)
Lapu-Lapu gains 3 times the Bravery Blessing from this skill and skills in transformed state.
For the next 10s, Lapu-Lapu enters Great Sword stance and gains enhanced skills, 30 , and his Basic Attack damage is increased to 120%.', '30', null, array['Morph', 'Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a7b0ba6060cb97e213bbb75c24404a2f.png'),
  (37, 4, 3712, 'Land Shaker', 'Lapu-Lapu channels for 0.7s, slowing enemies in the target direction by 60%. He then slams his heavy sword to the ground, dealing 250 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit and stunning them for 1s. (This skill can only be interrupted by Suppression.)', '10', null, array['CC', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_314a8fc8ae1bed40e359345d5f4d31a0.png'),
  (37, 5, 3723, 'Storm Sword', 'Lapu-Lapu whirls his heavy sword, dealing 250 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to nearby enemies.

When hitting an enemy hero, Lapu-Lapu gains 20% Damage Reduction, plus an additional 8% for each extra enemy hero hit, lasting 3s.', '6', null, array['Reduce DMG', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d09db3b0fb47d66e6ce2c80371141c68.png'),
  (37, 6, 3731, 'Raging Slash', 'Lapu-Lapu swings his heavy sword 3 times. The first two attacks deal 345 (+160% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage each, while the third deals 440 (+210% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in a large area.

Lapu-Lapu gains Control Immunity during this process and can change his attack direction and move a short distance on each attack.', '40', null, array['Burst', 'Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_77042b1a4020eef7c59fc51ac080a91c.png'),
  (38, 0, 3840, 'Nether Touch', 'Vexana and her Eternal Guard inflict Nether Touch on enemies hit. The mark lasts 5s and causes the affected enemy to explode upon death, dealing 108-500 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies (base damage scales with level).', null, null, array['Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4a772fea90f7fef17b012afc119091a7.png'),
  (38, 1, 3810, 'Deathly Grasp', 'Vexana unleashes a Deathly Grasp in the target direction, dealing 200 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in its path. It stops upon hitting an enemy hero, Terrifying and knocking them back. After a short delay, it explodes, dealing 200 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies and Terrifying them for 1s.', '14', '80 mana', array['CC', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_306fd329581b6ea4590086598d250df1.png'),
  (38, 2, 3820, 'Cursed Blast', 'Vexana marks the target area with the power of the undead, striking it after a 0.8s delay and dealing 580 (+165% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit.', '7', '60 mana', array['AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f0142fc0def21fe074ec6feb4a24fa07.png'),
  (38, 3, 3830, 'Eternal Guard', 'Vexana summons an Eternal Guard at the target location, dealing 480 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit and knocking them airborne for 0.8s. The Eternal Guard then joins Vexana in battle for 15s. Its attacks deal 200 (+40% Total Magic Power) (+ 5% target''s ) Magic Damage and Splash Damage in a large area.', '60', '120 mana', array['Summon', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1a95d813fc47cb5ec048784dacd7b46e.png'),
  (39, 0, 3940, 'Full Moon Curse', 'Roger can freely switch between human and wolf forms.

In human form, Roger''s Basic Attack and skills deal additional damage equal to 4% of the target''s current .

In wolf form, Roger''s Basic Attack and skills deal additional damage equal to 4% of the target''s lost .

This effect can only deal up to 60 additional damage against creeps.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_09769166146e91d618341d4a45dbbf70.png'),
  (39, 1, 3910, 'Open Fire', 'Roger fires two quick shots in the target direction, dealing a total of 250 (+125% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the enemy hit.
The first shot is a hunter net that slows the enemy by 80% for 1.5s.
The second is a bullet that reduces the enemy''s by 10 for 5s.', '7', '50 mana', array['Damage', 'Debuff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f6a7a6f89ad205b579985ea0e5ac28a1.png'),
  (39, 2, 3920, 'Hunter''s Steps', 'Roger gains 20% Movement Speed and 20% Attack Speed for 2.5s.', '10', '50 mana', array['Speed Up']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_42cfcbb066e1aef866c0cc1b9221811a.png'),
  (39, 3, 3930, 'Wolf Transformation', 'Roger lunges in the target direction and turns into wolf form, dealing 150 (+100% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit and slowing them by 90% for 0.8s.

Passive: In wolf form, Roger gains 20 and 25 Movement Speed.', '7.5', null, array['Morph', 'Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d414e77c739a173de440616d47260dd8.png'),
  (39, 4, 3911, 'Lycan Pounce', 'Roger lunges at the target enemy, becoming untargetable while dealing 250 (+125% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to up to 3 enemies in the area.

Getting a kill or assist will reduce the cooldown of this skill by 80%.', '15', '50 mana', array['Mobility', 'Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3c6152c1e1bb2ceae95818e06bcfed86.png'),
  (39, 5, 3922, 'Bloodthirsty Howl', 'Roger lets out a howl, increasing his Attack Speed by 1.15 times for 5s and revealing nearby enemy heroes with HP below 40%. If there are enemy heroes with HP below 40% in range, Roger gains 50% Movement Speed.', '10', '50 mana', array['Buff', 'Speed Up']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c593ba4f2bebc21c6e099256e94ef2ec.png'),
  (39, 6, 3932, 'Restore Human Form', 'Roger rolls in the target direction and reverts back to human form, gaining a 200 (+200% Extra Physical Attack) shield for 1.5s.', '7.5', null, array['Morph', 'Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b11d01d56251927771353cdb54a1f59b.png'),
  (40, 0, 4040, 'Lightwheel Mark', 'Karrie''s Basic Attacks and skills apply a stack of Lightwheel Mark on hit.
Once a target has 5 stacks of Lightwheel Marks, the marks will turn into a lightwheel, dealing True Damage equal to 5 (+1% Extra Physical Attack)% of the target''s to them (only up to 300 damage against creeps).', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8e05b54046cde777fe5e1f2790e8dff8.png'),
  (40, 1, 4010, 'Spinning Lightwheel', 'Karrie releases a sphere of surging energy in the target direction, dealing 250 (+90% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in its path. The sphere will stop upon hitting an enemy hero or reaching its max travel distance, continuously dealing 150 (+20% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to nearby enemies and slowing them by 80% for 1s.', '8', '65 mana', array['AOE', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_db5f9ad9a119521901a51a7691656afb.png'),
  (40, 2, 4020, 'Phantom Step', 'Karrie dashes in the target direction while throwing a lightwheel at the nearest enemy, dealing 150 (+70% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and applying a stack of Lightwheel Mark on them.

When in Dual Wield state, Karrie throws two lightwheels instead.', '4.5', '35 mana', array['Mobility', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1d3567f2e8613a30d531c25d987b09e2.png'),
  (40, 3, 4030, 'Speedy Lightwheel', 'Karrie enters Dual Wield state for 10s, gaining 20% Movement Speed. Each Basic Attack deals 40 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and throws 2 lightwheels that inherit a portion of Attack Effects.', '35', '100 mana', array['Buff', 'Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1a9f31cc93421fb6bcd5ef01d86a96f8.png'),
  (41, 0, 4140, 'Steel Bones', 'Gatotkaca gains equal to 2% of his lost HP (up to 200). He gains 5 Rage (up to 100) for every 300 damage taken (calculated before reduction).

Upon reaching 25 Rage, Gatotkaca''s next Basic Attack is enhanced, consuming all Rage to deal (+100% Total Physical Attack) (+200% Total Magic Power) (+ 8.2-11 * Consumed Rage) Magic Damage (scales with hero level) and recover (8 * Consumed Rage) HP.', null, null, array['Buff', 'Heal']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2bcf1c5dea0b73298389955379bdc6b4.png'),
  (41, 1, 4110, 'Blast Iron Fist', 'Gatotkaca slams the ground, creating a shattered zone in the target direction while dealing 200 (+150% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies within. Enemies in the shattered zone will take 100 (+20% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage per second and be slowed by 30%.', '8', null, array['AOE', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_14b9b342dddb7cc721b7e93ba38a33ff.png'),
  (41, 2, 4120, 'Unbreakable', 'Gatotkaca begins channeling, then sprints in the target direction with a battle cry, taunting enemies on the path to attack him, dealing 200 (+100% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage for 0.9 - 1.5s. The taunt duration and sprint distance scale with the channel time. Canceling the skill reduces 50% of the remaining cooldown.', '12', null, array['CC', 'Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6c888f8a9fb4daac350896e27d7f49eb.png'),
  (41, 3, 4130, 'Avatar of the Guardian', 'Gatotkaca jumps to the target location, dealing 500 (+300% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies and knocking them airborne for 1s. Enemies near the center of the area will be knocked airborne for a longer duration, while enemies on the fringes will be pulled to the center.

The camera will move with the skill indicator but won''t grant extra sight.', null, null, array['CC', 'Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_072e55d9347652eb686b7539943887de.png'),
  (42, 0, 4240, 'Magic Master', 'Harley''s mastery of magic allows his Basic Attacks and skills to reduce the enemy''s by 2 and increase his Attack Speed by 5% - 10% (scales with hero level) for 3s on hit. This effect stacks up to 10 times.
Harley''s Basic Attacks deal 60 (+50% Total Physical Attack)(+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage.', null, null, array['Debuff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3e9d943a0869ad60139cba7c8d3a3f0f.png'),
  (42, 1, 4210, 'Poker Trick', 'Harley throws 3 waves of cards, 3 cards per wave. Each card deals 120 (+25% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies.
After the same target is hit 3 time(s), the damage will decay to 50% on subsequent hits.', '6', '55 mana', array['AOE', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b585f6e1f81d05d3fe3461082ce1805b.png'),
  (42, 2, 4220, 'Space Escape', 'Harley blinks in the designated direction, leaving a magic hat at his starting location. His Movement Speed increases by 60% for 2s, then rapidly decays to normal over 4s.

Use Again: Return to the hat''s location.', '9', '75 mana', array['Mobility', 'Speed Up']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_700b842bae382a89c330491ee17ccd3b.png'),
  (42, 3, 4230, 'Deadly Magic', 'Harley casts a magic ring of fire at an enemy hero, dealing 200 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and a 40% slow effect that decays to 15% after 1.5s. The ring will stay around the target, during which Harley can hit the ring to damage the target. The ring will explode after 4s, dealing Magic Damage equal to 200 (+50% Total Magic Power) plus 30% of the damage taken by the target while the ring was active.', '36', '120 mana', array['Burst', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0057a5d751c27f6e56d3f105e27e989b.png'),
  (43, 0, 4340, 'Jungle Heart', 'Irithel and Leo''s immaculate teamwork allows her to shoot while moving. Each Basic Attack will shoot 2 crossbow bolt(s) (but takes longer to refill) that deal (+55% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage per bolt (inherits a portion of Attack Effects).
Moving will build up Jungle Heart, up to a maximum of 10 units, and cause the next Basic Attack to unleash 1 additional bolt(s).', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c5a562745b928518fe5a1021d74eb541.png'),
  (43, 1, 4310, 'Strafe', 'Irithel launches a volley of arrows on the target area, dealing 330 (+60% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies within and reducing their by 15 for 3s.', '10', null, array['AOE', 'Debuff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_fa31f958db6f4955abb8c1601d09840d.png'),
  (43, 2, 4320, 'Force of The Queen', 'Leo lets out a piercing roar, dealing 200 (+60% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to nearby enemies and slowing them by 40% for 2s.', '10', null, array['Slow', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2e73066af2cc13979e1bed2bba0d3d8f.png'),
  (43, 3, 4330, 'Heavy Crossbow', 'Irithel orders Leo to leap in the target direction and empowers her crossbow for 10s. For the duration, she gains 30 Movement Speed and her Basic Attacks shoot enhanced crossbow bolts, dealing 100 (+65% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the target and nearby units. Jungle Heart also accumulates faster for the duration.', '30', null, array['Buff', 'Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_eba682528a82c53362daf41147f0034f.png'),
  (44, 0, 4440, 'Bastion of Stone', 'Grock gains a shield equal to 14% and empowers the next Basic Attack to deal 4 (+2% Total Physical Defense)% target''s Physical Damage (capped at 300 (+20*Hero Level) against non-hero units). Cooldown: 18s - 12s (decreases with level). This cooldown is reduced by 200% when near terrain.
Grock''s skills cannot be interrupted, and he gains 30 (+6*Hero Level)% extra while the shield is active.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_bb06fa77cd649eff0cc061706e029182.png'),
  (44, 1, 4410, 'Mighty Swing', 'Grock strikes forward with massive force, dealing 240 (+100% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage. Enemies with obstacles behind them are knocked back into the obstacle, knocked airborne, and take 4 (+2% Total Physical Defense)% extra Physical Damage (capped at 300 (+20*Hero Level) against non-hero units). If there are no obstacles behind, enemies are only knocked back slightly.', '8', null, array['CC', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b4b1b8b21935b3455b44981f2a01404d.png'),
  (44, 2, 4420, 'Earthen Rampart', 'After a brief delay, Grock summons a stone wall in the target area, dealing 100 (+60% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage and knocking enemies towards him.
Use Again: Cancel the wall early.', '14', null, array['CC', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e19cfc03bbe289fccbfc89a1ef6668be.png'),
  (44, 3, 4430, 'Tectonic Charge', 'Grock charges forward and gains Control Immunity, dealing 100 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in his path. Upon hitting terrain, he immediately stops and triggers a massive explosion that knocks nearby enemies airborne for 1s and deals 650 (+300% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage. If this skill doesn''t hit terrain, 50% of its cooldown is refunded.', '55', null, array['Mobility', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5226d8dc97b10a6a1a2416b3957dfc7f.png'),
  (45, 0, 4540, 'Warmonger', 'Malice Energy grants Argus an initial Crit Chance of 30%. Argus''s Crits are converted into Demonic Slash, which ignores 30% of the target''s , deals 90 (+25% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage, and recovers 140 HP.

Demonic Slash cannot Crit, but can still trigger Crit-related effects.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f8a28cd195d4ec474f361daee0d0de6c.png'),
  (45, 1, 4510, 'Demonic Grip', 'First Cast: Argus stretches out a demonic hand in the target direction, dealing 125 (+60% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the first enemy hero or creep hit, stunning them for 0.7s. Both Argus and the target are pulled toward each other, then the target is slowed by 40% for 2s.
If no enemy is hit, Argus pulls himself toward the hand''s destination instead.

Use Again: Argus dashes and performs a wide slash, dealing 175 (+100% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage.', '12', null, array['Mobility', 'Debuff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b90caeb8b5854f2585f4c9af760e026a.png'),
  (45, 2, 4520, 'Meteoric Sword', 'After a short charge, Argus thrusts his Meteoric Sword in the target direction, dealing 120 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage. If this hits an enemy hero, Argus briefly stuns them and gains 30% Attack Speed for 3s. Meteoric Sword''s damage also gains a 40% boost to Crit Chance and Crit Damage.

Meteoric Sword counts as a Basic Attack and can trigger Attack Effects. Attack Speed shortens the charge time.', '8', null, array['CC', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_79110528884ec6365c2e9395dc1bc11b.png'),
  (45, 3, 4530, 'Eternal Evil', 'Argus removes all control effects, gains Death Immunity for 4s, and deals 300 (+180% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to nearby enemies. This damage scales with Argus''s lost HP, dealing up to 50% extra damage when his HP falls below 30%.
When Death Immunity ends, Argus recovers HP equal to all damage dealt to enemy heroes during its duration.

Passive: If Argus takes fatal damage while Eternal Evil is not on cooldown, he automatically enters Death Immunity.', '45', null, array['Death Immunity', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_41fe2a5e02169da266ce942372ad1e91.png'),
  (46, 0, 4640, 'Lakeshore Ambience', 'For 8s after casting a skill, Odette''s next Basic Attack gains extra range and bounces between enemies (or an enemy and herself), dealing 144-200 (+50% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage per hit.

Odette''s skills also trigger this effect on hit (up to 3 stacks).', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ea1dc3bb32cd7ca47e7a8aa0c0864278.png'),
  (46, 1, 4610, 'Avian Authority', 'Odette releases a magic swan in the target direction, dealing 300 (+150% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit and slowing them by 30% for 2s.', '6', '65 mana', array['AOE', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e97b9ebeb8147c1ddd5610e36b4541cd.png'),
  (46, 2, 4620, 'Blue Nova', 'Odette releases magic energy balls in the target direction, dealing 250 (+50% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to the first enemy hit and immobilizing them for 1.5s. Upon hit, an energy ball splits off to attack a nearby enemy (prioritizes enemy heroes), dealing 250 (+50% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and immobilizing them for 1.5s.', '12', '75 mana', array['CC', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_630483c59b2a2eb1c6b9f3bdfc369dc8.png'),
  (46, 3, 4630, 'Swan Song', 'Odette channels a dance, gaining a 1200 (+150% Total Magic Power) shield and dealing up to 2000 (+750% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies in a large area for 5s. During this time, her Movement Speed is reduced by 40%, but she can move freely.

Use again to cancel. Only high-level control effects can interrupt this skill.', '50', '160 mana', array['Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2f47fdb064b3c880cfc853d921ef090b.png'),
  (47, 0, 4740, 'Soul Cutter', 'Each time Lancelot charges, his damage is increased by 7.5% for 4s, up to 30%.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ae0f65f46319169e0086c9249b921b16.png'),
  (47, 1, 4710, 'Puncture', 'Lancelot charges in the target direction, dealing 150 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies along the way and applying a Sword Mark to the first unmarked enemy hit. The Sword Mark lasts 3s.

If Lancelot successfully applies a Sword Mark to an enemy, the skill''s cooldown will be reset.', '14', '40 mana', array['Mobility', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_60c8287e6736521c1c00d1eda3bc07bf.png'),
  (47, 2, 4720, 'Thorned Rose', 'Lancelot strikes in the target direction 3 times, each time dealing 220 (+120% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit (damage is reduced when multiple enemies are hit). He''s untargetable during this process. Enemies in the center of the area take all the 3 hits and are slowed by 20% for 0.5s. The slow effect can stack.', '11', '60 mana', array['AOE', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_146f3578adb9187559996d65a9bcab8b.png'),
  (47, 3, 4730, 'Phantom Execution', 'After a short delay, Lancelot performs an executioner''s strike in the target direction, dealing 350 (+170% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit. He is invincible throughout the process.', '36', '100 mana', array['Burst', 'Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_410d2071fe2e9cfeaed0001e1b942229.png'),
  (48, 0, 4840, 'Young Again', 'Upon death, Diggie reverses time and turns back to egg form, in which he can continue to move around and gains a new set of skills. He cannot be targeted in egg form and will revive after a period of time.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c925354be703b164f4cb1e334f7f0999.png'),
  (48, 1, 4810, 'Auto Alarm Bomb', 'Diggie flings an owl alarm to the target location that remains stationary for 25s or until it reacts to the first enemy in range, chasing them and exploding upon collision. The explosion deals 350 (+100% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit and slows them by 30%.

Diggie gains 2 stacks of Dangerous Sparks each time an enemy hero is hit by the explosion (up to 60 stacks), each stack increasing the skill''s damage by 1%. He loses half the stacks upon death, but can gain 1 stack of Dangerous Sparks each time his skill hits an enemy hero when in egg form.

Up to 5 owl alarms can exist at the same time.', '8', '70 mana', array['AOE', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c86c657882cc6e1d60d78de99684630b.png'),
  (48, 2, 4820, 'Reverse Time', 'Diggie marks the target enemy hero for 4s and pulls them back to their previous location after the duration ends, dealing 150 (+100% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and briefly slowing them by 80%.

If the enemy moves out of the circle, the pull will be triggered early.', '15', '90 mana', array['CC', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_89a503e45d0aa3d3118f3bf9860f7793.png'),
  (48, 3, 4830, 'Time Journey', 'Diggie removes all debuffs on nearby allied heroes (including himself) and grants them a 650 (+300% Total Magic Power) shield and Control Immunity for 2s. He also gains 50% Movement Speed for 0.5s.', '76', '130 mana', array['CC Immune', 'Speed Up']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_51ad0888fa262bf92b3cadf75b7d371c.png'),
  (49, 0, 4940, 'Thickened Blood', 'Hylos gains 1 extra Max Mana for every 2.5 Extra gained.
When out of Mana, he can consume HP to cast skills.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_81f19961357acccd7005193849dc05ac.png'),
  (49, 1, 4910, 'Law and Order', 'Hylos gains 50% Movement Speed and causes his next Basic Attack within 3s to deal 300 (+80% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to the target, knocking back and stunning them for 1s.

The extra Movement Speed rapidly decays over the duration and vanishes after the next Basic Attack.', '12', null, array['CC', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6dc51b5af13742c8a0fb9e0dd1d0cb93.png'),
  (49, 2, 4920, 'Ring of Punishment', 'Hylos releases the Ring of Punishment, dealing 100 (+20% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies per second while slowing them by 4% and reducing their Attack Speed by 7.5% for 2.5s (up to 8 stacks). Each stack also increases the enemy''s damage taken from the Ring of Punishment by 5%. The Ring of Punishment consumes 30 Mana per second when it''s active.

Use Again: Hylos cancels the Ring of Punishment.', '1', null, array['AOE', 'Debuff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_068a1e4a7a26457bba3aadb5b7b3e675.png'),
  (49, 3, 4930, 'Glorious Pathway', 'Hylos creates a huge pathway in the target direction, reducing enemies'' Movement Speed by 75% for 1s. The pathway lasts 6s.
When on the pathway, Hylos gains Slow Immunity and recovers 3% per second. Allied heroes moving along the pathway gain 60% extra Movement Speed, while enemy heroes on the pathway will be slowed by 25%.', '40', null, array['Speed Up', 'Heal']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_fb95da3d348806ddefba457bafd30e9f.png'),
  (50, 0, 5050, 'Decimation', 'Upon death, Zhask summons a frenzied Nightmaric Spawn on the spot, which gradually loses HP over time until death.', null, null, array['Summon']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c917fad570226db1fe802ef590ce37dc.png'),
  (50, 1, 5010, 'Nightmaric Spawn', 'Zhask summons a Nightmaric Spawn that inherits 55% of his , , and . It automatically fires Death Ray at nearby enemies, dealing 55 (+ 20%) (+ 20% Extra Attack Speed) Magic Damage and slowing them by up to 30%. It disappears when Zhask moves too far away.

Death Ray is considered a Basic Attack but cannot Crit.

Fusion Enhanced: Nightmaric Spawn deals 180% damage and can be repositioned.', '13', '60 mana', array['Summon']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4d3d9495ced41a0034c6ae2f3c8abb23.png'),
  (50, 2, 5020, 'Mind Eater', 'Zhask fires a penetrating psychic beam in the target direction, dealing 300 (+100% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage. Afterward, the Nightmaric Spawn attacks enemies hit by Mind Eater, dealing 120 (+80% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and stunning them for 0.5s.

Fusion Enhanced: Mind Eater damage is increased to 540 (+180% Total Magic Power).', '8', '50 mana', array['CC', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4738fbff79c44b4aa3bd2bd943840032.png'),
  (50, 3, 5030, 'Hive Clones', 'Zhask releases a swarm of Hive Clones in the target direction. The clones explode upon hitting an enemy, dealing 55 (+18% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and reducing their Movement Speed by 80% for 1s.
If the Hive Clones hit no target, they burrow into the ground to ambush passing enemies.

Fusion Enhanced: Zhask releases several swarms of Hive Clones.
Subsequent damage to the same target decays to 20%.', '10', '60 mana', array['Slow', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_47dcb2a530907fafc065d9363e941bae.png'),
  (50, 4, 5040, 'Dominator''s Descent', 'Zhask selects a target area to summon an enhanced Nightmaric Spawn and fuses with it. Nightmaric Spawn can inherit 100% of his attributes and get extra attributes. His skills are enhanced during the fusion period.

Use Again: Zhask immediately gets off the Nightmaric Spawn and loses enhancement.', '48', '120 mana', array['Morph', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3174faca2ab0b0d6c0dd9d1af22f47df.png'),
  (51, 0, 5140, 'Shadow of Styx', 'Helcurt remains in Prowler state until spotted by the enemy team, gaining 15% extra Movement Speed, and continuously regenerating (+30% Total Physical Attack) HP if he has not dealt any damage.
He gains 50% extra Attack Speed and 50% extra Movement Speed (decreasing over time) for 4s upon being spotted and leaves Prowler state 0.75s later.
Any hero killed after being hit by Helcurt leaves a dark fog that explodes and spreads with a cooldown of 10s. Helcurt Conceals himself while within the dark fog.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_dc8d2817dd15f112fee407d391b40263.png'),
  (51, 1, 5110, 'Hidden Terror', 'Passive: When Helcurt is in the Prowler state, Terrify also affects enemy heroes hit and briefly reveals them. Its cooldown decreases 3 times as fast as normal.
Active: Helcurt blinks to the target location and deals 150 (+70% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in the area, reducing their Movement Speed by 60% for 0.75s.', '15', null, array['Mobility', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c382e8831549b8418b96bd2bf1a1a747.png'),
  (51, 2, 5120, 'Deadly Stinger', 'Passive: Helcurt gains 1 Deadly Stinger for every 1.5s spent in Prowler state or on each Basic Attack. Up to 5 Deadly Stingers can be stored.

Active: Helcurt fires all Deadly Stingers forward, each dealing 180 (+50% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies (minions and creeps take only 70% of the damage).
Deadly Stinger counts as a Basic Attack but cannot Crit.', '4', null, array['Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_488c8c77f2759c625d9b480310190446.png'),
  (51, 3, 5130, 'Dark Night Falls', 'Helcurt summons the Dark Night, reducing all enemies'' sight range and blocking ally vision sharing for 3s. During Dark Night, Helcurt gains 40% extra Movement Speed.

The Dark Night makes it easier for Helcurt to leave enemies'' sight range.', '60', null, array['Buff', 'Debuff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_85ec55d4fae0baee5fc5b776963020c5.png'),
  (52, 0, 5240, 'Spiritual Unity', 'Every 5s to 8s (scales with Feathered Air Strike level), Verri enters the Hunting state. On Pharsa''s next attack against an enemy hero, Verri deals extra Magic Damage equal to 8% of the target''s (+ 1% per 200 ) and slows them by 60% for 1s.', null, null, array['Damage', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ebde3d94865d5d05527b4becf8099d61.png'),
  (52, 1, 5210, 'Curse of Crow', 'Pharsa unleashes a blast of magic at the target location, dealing 300 (+120% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit and marking them for 4s.

When Pharsa hits a marked enemy with a Basic Attack or active skill, the mark is consumed, stunning them for 1s.

Marked enemies will have their positions revealed.', '8', '60 mana', array['CC', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f742fccb6bbc9436b3085a1ee4b740f7.png'),
  (52, 2, 5220, 'Energy Impact', 'Pharsa releases magic energy in the target direction, dealing 475 (+145% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit.', '6.5', '60 mana', array['AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_dcf364fc10b2a3ee13ba23a6d56f7987.png'),
  (52, 3, 5230, 'Feathered Air Strike', 'Passive: Each level-up reduces Spiritual Unity''s interval by 1s.
Active: Pharsa takes flight for 8s and bombards the target area, dealing 530 (+160% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies within. This skill can be cast up to 4 times during the flight.', '36', '120 mana', array['Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f0d9ce0152491c148821703d1e31d802.png'),
  (52, 4, 5250, 'Wings by Wings', 'Pharsa turns into mist and wraps around Verri, gaining 150% extra Movement Speed (decays over time) and the ability to fly over terrain for 5s.

This state ends immediately when she is controlled or uses a Basic Attack or skill.', '23', null, array['Morph', 'Speed Up']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_566a1f86bd9177eb7b75f0fb0a0c762c.png'),
  (53, 0, 5340, 'Lethal Shot', 'If Lesley doesn''t take damage for 5s, her next Basic Attack gains extra range and 50% Crit Chance and deals 100 (+100% Total Physical Attack) True Damage (20% extra damage against minions).
Each point of fixed Physical Penetration and each 1% Physical Penetration Lesley acquires is converted into 1% Crit Damage, but her base Crit Damage is reduced to 130%.
Lesley''s Basic Attack restores 5 points of energy and her Lethal Shot doubles the amount of energy restored. The Lethal Shot effect will activate immediately after Lesley uses a skill.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_296a3745ef0ec7c978400b3e7f481030.png'),
  (53, 1, 5310, 'Master of Camouflage', 'Lesley enters the Camouflage state, gaining double Energy Regen, 40% extra Movement Speed, and 85 extra .
The state lasts 3s or until Lesley takes or deals damage. Enemies can detect Lesley''s position through distortions of their surroundings.', '3.5', '30 energy', array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a8caf30fc02cfaa2f500311936dbfc31.png'),
  (53, 2, 5320, 'Tactical Grenade', 'Lesley throws a tactical grenade in the target direction while jumping back slightly, dealing 150 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in a fan-shaped area and knocking them back.

Lesley can cast this skill during Ultimate Snipe to cancel the state and immediately fire a Fatal Bullet at the target. The attack is only triggered when there are unfired Fatal Bullets left.', '10', '40 energy', array['CC', 'Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_18a15ed9f8facd0926ea8a8ecd200e25.png'),
  (53, 3, 5330, 'Ultimate Snipe', 'Passive: Lesley''s Crit Chance is increased by 10%.
Active: Lesley locks onto an enemy hero and fires 4 Fatal Bullets in succession. Each bullet deals 250 (+80% Extra Physical Attack) (+ 5% of the target''s lost ) Physical Damage and restores 10 Energy on hit. Bullets can be blocked by other enemy heroes.

If this skill is interrupted, each remaining bullet reduces this skill''s cooldown by 10%.', '40', null, array['Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c6126c3a551ed56f43e76df1f21510d2.png'),
  (54, 0, 5440, 'Mecha Suppression', 'Each time Jawhead deals damage to an enemy hero or a Creep, he inflicts a stack of Mecha Suppression on them for 3s (up to 6 stacks). Each stack of Mecha Suppression increases all damage dealt to the target by 2% (limited to 50% for Creeps).', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_be1d9f5cde5273770efe9549f6d374e0.png'),
  (54, 1, 5410, 'Smart Missiles', 'Jawhead launches up to 12 missiles at random nearby enemies over 5s, each missile dealing 135 (+30% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the enemy hit.', '5', '60 mana', array['Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_24e71b01ad4b25441dc2874018c16771.png'),
  (54, 2, 5420, 'Ejector', 'Jawhead gains 30% Movement Speed and a 500 (+100% Total Physical Attack) shield for 5s.

Use Again: Jawhead flings the nearest unit (prioritizes heroes) to the target location, dealing 300 (+80% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in the area and stunning them for 0.5s. Can be used on allied heroes and they will not take damage.', '15', '80 mana', array['Shield', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b8e015be6d7c3f44d07c7821c86d340e.png'),
  (54, 3, 5430, 'Unstoppable Force', 'Jawhead charges into the target enemy hero, dealing 350 (+150% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and briefly stunning them. Enemies around the target are knocked back and dealt the same amount of damage. Jawhead is immune to control effects during the charge.', '35', '120 mana', array['Mobility', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b206f68d351dbf04a3e211903b345985.png'),
  (55, 0, 5540, 'Smart Heart', 'Angela gains 5% extra Movement Speed for 4s each time she casts a skill (up to 20%). When she''s attached to an allied hero, the Movement Speed boost is transferred to the allied hero.', null, null, array['Speed Up']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_a43559c89c118c816b669fa49b45e76f.png'),
  (55, 1, 5510, 'Love Waves', 'Angela sends Love Waves in the target direction, dealing 170 (+80% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit, revealing their positions briefly, and applying a stack of Lover''s Mark (up to 5 stacks). Each stack of Lover''s Mark increases the damage by 20% and slows enemies hit by 8% for 3s.
Love Waves also restore 150 (+75% Total Magic Power) HP to allied heroes hit. Angela can store up to 5 charges of this skill, and the charge time is affected by Cooldown Reduction.
When attached to allies, this skill''s cooldown is reduced by 50%.', '2', '60 mana', array['Heal', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6f7b56ae09ae397b07ad30d8c94164ae.png'),
  (55, 2, 5520, 'Puppet-on-a-String', 'Angela launches a Puppet String at the target enemy (excluding minions), dealing 300 (+40% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and gradually slowing them by up to 80%. If the enemy is still connected to the string after 3s, they''ll be immobilized for 1.5s and take 450 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage.

Each stack of Lover''s Mark increases the final damage by 20%.', '13', '90 mana', array['Slow', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0f32c780347021165ab869944f1c981c.png'),
  (55, 3, 5530, 'Heartguard', 'Angela begins channeling, applying a 600 (+150% Total Magic Power) shield to the target allied hero regardless of distance. Once attached to an ally, the shield remains until detached. After the channeling is complete, she attaches herself to the allied hero for 20s, during which she can cast skills at zero Mana cost.
Angela can cast this skill again to cancel the channeling or detach herself from the allied hero. The attaching state will end early if the allied hero is killed.', '60', '100 mana', array['Attach', 'Shield']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d1c3f421da66e26aa3e0d8749f9f39de.png'),
  (56, 0, 5640, 'Dagger Specialist', 'Each skill cast adds a rune to Gusion''s dagger (stacks up to 4 times). Each stack enhances Gusion''s next Basic Attack to deal additional damage equal to 3% of the target''s and recover 50 (+25% Total Magic Power) HP for himself.', null, null, array['Buff', 'Heal']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_dd599ad04fa456a864ea1e34e14d7739.png'),
  (56, 1, 5610, 'Sword Spike', 'Gusion throws a dagger in the target direction, dealing 200 (+50% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to the first enemy hit and marking them.

Use Again: Gusion moves behind the marked enemy, dealing 200 (+100% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to them. This skill cannot be interrupted while Gusion is moving behind the marked enemy.', '9', '50 mana', array['Damage', 'Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3c2d474c18f5d10925a4c732992df352.png'),
  (56, 2, 5620, 'Shadowblade Slaughter', 'Gusion throws a volley of daggers in the target direction, each dealing 100 (+40% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit and slowing them by 6% for 2s (when hit by multiple daggers, the slow effect can stack up to 30%).

Use Again: Gusion recalls the daggers, each dealing 65 (+40% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in its path.', '9', '60 mana', array['AOE', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_40bc6e5205c84fb8cd337031ca8480d0.png'),
  (56, 3, 5630, 'Incandescence', 'Gusion dashes to the target location, resetting the cooldowns of Sword Spike and Shadowblade Slaughter. If Shadowblade Slaughter was cast once before the reset, Gusion can throw another five daggers on his next Shadowblade Slaughter cast, and recall a total of ten daggers afterward.

Use Again: Gusion dashes a short distance in the target direction.', '24', '100 mana', array['Mobility', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6ffa279a397359b614e8acecde38c0bb.png'),
  (57, 0, 5740, 'Ashing', 'Valir''s skills apply a stack of Ablaze to enemies hit, dealing them Magic Damage equal to 1 (+0.2% Total Magic Power)% of their per second for 3s.

At 3 stacks, the fire detonates, dealing Magic Damage equal to 5 (+1% Total Magic Power)% of the target''s and stunning them for 1s.
A target can only be stunned by Valir''s skills once every 7s.', null, null, array['CC', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_65b74c606ad3b8d47f18b6f87bc25bee.png'),
  (57, 1, 5710, 'Burst Fireball', 'Valir launches a fireball that explodes upon hitting the first target, dealing 235 (+80% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and slowing them by 30% for 1s. The flame on the ground explodes after 1s, dealing 118 (+40% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage.

Valir recharges 1 fireball every 9s (up to 2 charges). Hitting an enemy hero or legend creep with this skill immediately restores 1 charge, while hitting a minion restores 4s of the recharge time.

Vengeance Flame: Increases the cast range of Burst Fireball by 30%.', '1.5', '45 mana', array['AOE', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_37f8cc042e3430f6afcf4a18e1c8d064.png'),
  (57, 2, 5720, 'Searing Torrent', 'Valir unleashes a torrent of flames in the target direction, dealing 200 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and knocking them back to the end of its path.

Vengeance Flame: The torrent forms a firewall at the end of its path that lasts 4s, dealing 100 (+30% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies every 1s.

Enemies hit by the torrent or the firewall are slowed by 25% for 1s.', '13', '75 mana', array['CC', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_d2289b367b7fb08328145563195346f6.png'),
  (57, 3, 5730, 'Vengeance Flame', 'Valir removes all debuffs on himself and gains 40% Movement Speed that decays over 3s. Meanwhile, he conjures 4 Vengeance Flames that enhance Burst Fireball and Searing Torrent for 9s.', '36', '100 mana', array['Remove CC', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_87bb3708c7ffb7391a768de2c82370a7.png'),
  (58, 0, 5840, 'Asura''s Wrath', 'Each time Martis uses a skill, his Attack Speed will be increased by 30%, 120% maximum. Lasts 4s. He gains (+8*Hero Level) extra Attack at full stacks.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f48a1786aeb1572d0309f509ddd0b444.png'),
  (58, 1, 5810, 'Asura Aura', 'Martis draws enemies to a fan-shaped area in front of him and deals 350 (+130% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage, slowing them by 40% for 2s.', '7', null, array['CC', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_dec679229c3d8b5f18144acfc2cda27f.png'),
  (58, 2, 5820, 'Mortal Coil', 'Martis strikes in the target direction three times, each time dealing 225 (+120% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit. Enemies hit by the first and third strike are also knocked back. The attack direction can be changed once using the Joystick.

