Martis gains Control Immunity and 60% Damage Reduction when casting this skill.', '8', null, array['Mobility', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_910d3e465d051726ab223b215b7cfdb5.png'),
  (58, 3, 5830, 'Decimation', 'Martis lunges at a designated enemy hero, dealing 700 (+120% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage (deals True Damage if the enemy''s HP is below 50%).
If the enemy is killed by this skill, Martis can cast the skill again within 10s and gains 100% extra Movement Speed that gradually decays over 5s. Each successive cast also increases the skill''s damage by 15% (up to 30%).', '36', null, array['Burst', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_bbdf118fe86a5279e943a6db86fc4d7a.png'),
  (59, 0, 5940, 'Radiance', 'Each time Uranus takes damage, he gains a stack of Radiance. Each stack recovers 1.2-11.2 HP (increases with level) every 0.8s for 10s, up to 20 stacks.
Uranus''s Basic Attacks deal (+80% Total Physical Attack) (+ 4-8 × Radiance stacks) Magic Damage (increases with level).', null, null, array['Heal']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_90324508ebba14fda61e55dfcf44b366.png'),
  (59, 1, 5910, 'Ionic Edge', 'Uranus releases 2 energy blades that orbit around him, dealing 155 (+30% Total Magic Power) (+6 × Radiance stacks) Magic Damage to enemies hit and slowing them by 30% for 2s.
Each blade can only damage the same target once.', '4', '60 mana', array['AOE', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_e6a35f29615510ea57f24f4bb68273ac.png'),
  (59, 2, 5920, 'Transcendent Ward', 'Uranus charges to the target location, dealing 80 (+20% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies along the way, and 160 (+80% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies at the target location and slowing them by 25%. Uranus also generates a 300 (+200% Total Magic Power) shield for 4s.

The shield explodes at the end of its duration or when destroyed, dealing 300 (+150% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies nearby.', '10', '80 mana', array['Mobility', 'Shield']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5a67db8e144ebcad419b61a347d0cfd2.png'),
  (59, 3, 5930, 'Consecration', 'Uranus unleashes the energy stored within his body, removing slow effects on himself, recovering 200 HP, and gaining 60% Movement Speed for 8s (decays over time).

Uranus directly gains 5 stacks of Radiance, increasing shields received and HP Regen by 20% for 8s.', '42', '100 mana', array['Buff', 'Speed Up']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1f92cbcc716af295b0e8702936fb19b7.png'),
  (60, 0, 6040, 'Ninjutsu: Petal Barrage', 'Hanabi''s Basic Attacks and skills launch Petal Blades upon hitting a target, dealing 30% damage and bouncing up to 4 times to nearby enemies. Petal Blades launched by Basic Attacks inherit Attack Effects.
If bounces from the same Basic Attack or skill hit the same target multiple times, subsequent bounces deal 30% less damage.', null, null, array['Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_062555a0aac422ba461293262f8092e0.png'),
  (60, 1, 6010, 'Ninjutsu: Equinox', 'Passive: Whenever Hanabi has a shield from any source, she is immune to control effects.
