  (100, 3, 10030, 'Torn-Apart Memory', 'Brody locks onto all enemies within 8 unit(s), dealing 216 (+165% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to them.
For each target with Abyss Mark stacks, all stacks are consumed, dealing additional Physical Damage equal to 94 (+72% Extra Physical Attack) (+ 4% of the target''s lost ) per stack.', '32', '120 mana', array['Burst', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_164e7e1000b258395f9350114636ddac.png'),
  (101, 0, 10140, 'Galactic Power', 'When Yve deals damage to enemy heroes with her skills, she gains Galactic Power (cooldown: 0.5s), up to 3 stacks. Each stack provides Yve with a 120 (+10*Hero Level) (+50% Total Magic Power) shield for 3s.', null, null, array['Shield']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4ecac2e5d0fd547b1fe1a125069db9b0.png'),
  (101, 1, 10110, 'Void Blast', 'Yve detonates Galactic Energy at the target location, dealing 290 (+150% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in the area.
Successfully hitting an enemy grants Yve 55% extra Movement Speed (halved if a non-hero enemy is hit) that decreases over 1s.', '3', '40 mana', array['AOE', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2b0a9f9e2cbb187184165463c80380f1.png'),
  (101, 2, 10120, 'Void Crystal', 'Yve summons a Void Crystal at the target location, dealing 220 (+40% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies.

Use Again: Yve commands the Crystal to fire materialized energy in the target direction for 2.7s, dealing 75 (+10% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage every 0.45s to enemies hit and slowing them by 20%. Enemies hit multiple times are slowed by an extra 4% for each hit after the first hit (up to 40%).', '14', '80 mana', array['Slow', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_38145b234973cae3a6b7ca31aa75266c.png'),
  (101, 3, 10130, 'Real World Manipulation', 'Yve creates a Starfield that lasts 15s. Within the duration, you can Tap or Swipe the screen to attack up to 20 times.
Tap: Deals 340 (+150% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in the target area.
Swipe: Deals 85 (+10% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage every 0.45s to enemies in the target area for 2.7s and slows them by 40%.
Enemies leaving or entering the Starfield will be immobilized for 0.8s (only once against the same target).
Yve cannot be displaced while the Starfield is active, and the Starfield will remain even if Yve is controlled (except for Suppression).', '60', '180 mana', array['Burst', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ee253ff416a10efd76a13cedce9aab4e.png'),
  (102, 0, 10240, 'Ancestral Guidance', 'Mathilda gains Ancestral Guidance while moving. When it''s fully charged, her next Basic Attack will be enhanced, dealing 200 (+100% Total Physical Attack) (+100% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to the target and granting her 80 extra Movement Speed that decays over 2.5s.', null, null, array['Damage', 'Speed Up']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f201e693e1129614b1b22047e28a4c2c.png'),
  (102, 1, 10210, 'Soul Bloom', 'Mathilda resonates with the power of her ancestors for 4s, attracting wisps as her movement distance increases (up to 6 wisps).

At the end of the skill''s duration, or when Mathilda casts this skill again, the wisps will seek and attack nearby enemies, each dealing 275 (+125% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and revealing the enemies'' positions briefly. Subsequent damage dealt by wisps to the same target decays to 40%.', '7.5', '50 mana', array['Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4b41810acba280a3b6e9bba321bfbb74.png'),
  (102, 2, 10220, 'Guiding Wind', 'Mathilda leaps in the target direction and creates a field around her, gaining a 350 (+180% Total Magic Power) shield and 25% extra Movement Speed for 3s. Allied heroes who come into contact with the field will receive a 50% shield and Guiding Wind. The first allied hero that triggers Guiding Wind will be guided to Mathilda, and both of them will gain the same Movement Speed boost.

When casting this skill during Circling Eagle, Mathilda won''t change her position.
Guiding Wind expires 2s after the hero leaves Mathilda''s field.', '13.5', '60 mana', array['Mobility', 'Shield']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9c364f42f896209e76c50e9460a9395e.png'),
  (102, 3, 10230, 'Circling Eagle', 'Mathilda applies a Soul Mark to the target enemy hero and circles around them for up to 3.5s, during which her wisps will fly into nearby enemies, each dealing 40 (+15% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage. The Soul Mark will also slow the target by 15% and Soul Bloom will prioritize the target with Soul Mark.
Within the duration, Mathilda can select an area to dash to. At the end of the duration, she''ll dash at the target with Soul Mark, dealing 320 (+120% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage while knocking enemies in her path airborne for 0.6s, transferring the Soul Mark to the first enemy hero that she knocks airborne, and reducing the skill cooldown by 40%.
Mathilda gains Control Immunity and a 400 (+180% Total Magic Power) shield for the skill duration.', '65', '120 mana', array['Mobility', 'Shield']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9dade03c4d55cf327e9f1cb279e99f29.png'),
  (103, 0, 10340, 'Champ Stance', 'Paquito gains a stack each time he casts a skill. At 3 stacks, he enters the Champ Stance and enhances his next skill.
Paquito''s enhanced skills have no cooldown and deal (+2*Hero Level)% extra damage to minions.

After casting any enhanced skill, Paquito gains 60% Movement Speed and (+2*Hero Level)% Damage Reduction for 1.2s.', null, null, array['Buff', 'Damage']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_355d974ddddee49aa368a23ce6261325.png'),
  (103, 1, 10310, 'Heavy Left Punch', 'Paquito throws a punch in the target direction, dealing 210 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit and gaining a 150 (+135% Total Physical Attack) shield.

Champ Stance: The damage is increased to 350 (+100% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage, and the shield value is increased to 140% for 2.5s (normal and enhanced shields can stack).', '7', null, array['AOE', 'Shield']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_272a8e256ea04a2cc61624913c1a3a0d.png'),
  (103, 2, 10320, 'Jab', 'Paquito dashes forward and throws a jab, dealing 200 (+165% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in his path and at the destination.

Champ Stance: Paquito''s jab becomes fiercer, dealing 300 (+210% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit.
The jab stops upon hitting a hero or creep.', '7', null, array['Burst', 'Mobility']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_c25b703eaad4be83ff1d2f9d8376efa6.png'),
  (103, 3, 10330, 'Knockout Strike', 'Paquito launches an elbow strike at enemies in the target direction, dealing 250 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and knocking them back to the destination.
He then throws a haymaker, dealing 300 (+90% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and slowing them by 75% for 1s, before darting backward.

Champ Stance: After knocking enemies back to the destination, Paquito launches an uppercut instead, dealing 400 (+120% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and knocking them airborne for 0.5s.', '15', null, array['CC', 'Burst']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_526a9945a05f076fe151ede742bd3d48.png'),
  (104, 0, 10440, 'Stick, Stick', 'Gloo''s skills apply a stack of Sticky to enemies on hit, decreasing their Movement Speed by 4% for 6s (up to 5 stacks).
Each Sticky stack on an attacker reduces their damage dealt to Gloo by 3%.', null, null, array['Slow', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4d78367e0a6c4f3269f64ddfad7f96d7.png'),
  (104, 1, 10410, 'Slam, Slam', 'Gloo reaches out and slams the ground, dealing 80 (+80% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies hit.
