Touching the Goo detonates it immediately and resets this skill''s cooldown. Gloo also recovers 2.5% if the explosion hits an enemy (doubled if it hits an enemy hero).', '10', '25 mana', array['AOE', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_79eeaa75b48d109dd048a18b06d97c2c.png'),
  (104, 2, 10420, 'Spread, Spread', 'Gloo splits into Goos, dealing 100 (+80% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies in a fan-shaped area and immobilizing them for 0.5s. For the next 4s, Gloo gains 10% Movement Speed and deals 80 (+15% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage every 0.25s to enemies it touches.
If this skill hits a Goo, Gloo charges toward it, dragging enemies in its path along for a distance.', '12', '80 mana', array['CC', 'AOE']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_975a075bf3dc864116d9fd55ce33aedc.png'),
  (104, 3, 10430, 'Grab, Grab', 'Unlocked when an enemy hero reaches max Sticky stacks. Gloo attaches itself to the target for up to 9s, recovering 20% .

