  (105, 6, 2010521, 'Tactical Reposition', 'Beatrix leaps nimbly forward, and fully reloads her current weapon.', null, null, array['Mobility', 'Buff']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_bb64cd50d3e37c9d8343716b796fb2cb.png'),
  (105, 7, 2010550, 'Bennett''s Rage', 'Beatrix focuses her rage and has Bennett rain down a bombardment on the target area 5 time(s). Each bombardment slows enemies by 40% and deals 580 (+225% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage (this damage decays to 20% when hitting the same target multiple times), lasting 1s.

