  (106, 0, 10640, 'Demonic Force', 'Phoveus''s next Basic Attack charges at the enemy, knocking them back, dealing extra Magic Damage equal to 4% - 6% of the enemy''s (scales with level), and gaining a 8% - 12% shield. Cooldown: 26s-14s (based on Infernal Pursuit''s level).

