  (106, 1, 10610, 'Demonic Impact', 'Phoveus slams his monolith into the ground, dealing 200 (+120% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in the area and slowing them by 70% for 0.5s. If this skill hits an enemy, Phoveus''s next Demonic Impact will leave behind an Astaros Eye.

Astaros Eye: Implodes after a short delay, dealing 100 (+60% Total Physical Attack) Magic Damage to the enemies.', '6', null, array['AOE', 'Slow']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5748e21d6ff5231b05a6acae7d4665c1.png'),
  (106, 2, 10620, 'Dark Wave', 'Phoveus lowers his monolith and releases his demonic power in the target direction, knocking enemies airborne, dragging them along, and dealing 250 (+100% Extra Physical Attack) Magic Damage.', '10', null, array['AOE', 'CC']::text[], 'https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0e6fc7263f921c1084d7a47805648fab.png'),
  (106, 3, 10630, 'Infernal Pursuit', 'Passive: Demonic Force, Astaros Eye, and Dark Wave apply Sinner''s Mark to enemy heroes hit.

